  "narrative": "The central accepted feature_010 pattern is now a context-dependent map: positive simple contrasts overall and in many non-high or mid signature contexts, attenuation by high feature_038 and high feature_018 separately, and a large opposite-sign contrast when high feature_038 and high feature_018 co-occur (H134). The proposed comparisons first test whether that joint-high reversal is robust to removing compositional contributors already known to move the endpoint. The f010 joint-high/excluding-f003 test asks whether the reversal remains after removing f003-positive samples, which are associated with lower outcome in high f036 contexts. The f037 joint-high/excluding-f010 test asks whether the large f037 lowering association remains even in f010-negative observations inside the same joint-high region, providing a complementary axis of association rather than an f010 artifact.\n\nThe three feature_010 contrasts inside high f036 sharpen the accepted f010-by-f036 signal. The no-modifier cell tests whether the positive f010 association remains when neither high f038 nor high f018 is present. The isolated high-f038-only and high-f018-only cells then test how much each attenuation modifier reduces the contrast while keeping the other modifier non-high. Together these distinguish an additive attenuation map from a sharper joint-threshold reversal.\n\nFor feature_003, the joint high-f038/high-f018 contrast excluding high f036 tests whether that signature combination can generate a lowering association independently of f036. The interaction test of feature_003 by high f018 inside non-high f036 is complementary to H124: it asks whether f018 modifies the f003 contrast outside f036, where the marginal f003 association is otherwise rejected. A null there would further localize f003 to high f036; an accepted interaction would indicate an independent but conditional modification.\n\nFinally, two broad untested binary predictors are screened to avoid concentrating only on already discovered axes. Anticipated directions are intentionally uncertain for several comparisons because the scientific goal is to map conditional structure rather than force a prior direction. All interpretations remain unadjusted associations within the supplied dataset and do not imply causality or external generalizability.",
  "research_notes": "Current dataset map: feature_037 lowering is broad and validated; feature_003 lowering is strongest in high f036 contexts; feature_010 is positive overall but attenuated/reversed by high f038 and high f018, with accepted joint-high reversal H134 and rejected original positive joint-high direction H126. New explore targets: (1) robustness of joint-high f010 reversal excluding f003; (2) robustness of f037 lowering in joint-high region restricted to f010=0; (3) high-f036 feature_010 baseline without f038/f018 modifiers and isolated one-modifier cells to compare additive attenuation with joint reversal; (4) f003 in joint high f038/f018 outside high f036 and f018 modification of f003 outside high f036; (5) broad screens for feature_060 and feature_063. Avoid underpowered three-way joint-high/high-f036 contrasts; validate only after discovery if new claims are precise and important."
